081FC1FC ratatosk-animated-pool

The failed Task_Create branch exits with its null result still in r0.
Ratatosk checks this result before continuing boss initialization.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/bosses/ratatosk/Ratatosk_CreateAnimatedParticlePool.c
+++ b/src/bosses/ratatosk/Ratatosk_CreateAnimatedParticlePool.c
@@ -15,3 +15,6 @@
         return r;
     }
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return r; // r0 is zero when Task_Create fails
+#endif
 }
